 "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "487236046744268", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75572754_487236050077601_8348865219296916010_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ekvYRmaBJJMQ7kNvwGi_SXv&_nc_oc=Ado7uhEAQ7cFiDCSeq9R6FikwEY7XcPovylllObeqO6R0vqR3GP2aPvwcQo5EvtguIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKUNhuwWnFiOLj06Ta3sC3DEqoXIc9SqktSQXUF1c9ftQ&oe=6AB543C1"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a campus", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a campus, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb), whose trajectory is about 5.2km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a campus, which was computed by photogrammetry from two 2496x2496 videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb) and by biking about 5.2km in the campus des C\u00e9zeaux (in Aubi\u00e8re, France)."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26725169960461721"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1636079193457061_1212892732761347295_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XaNsEhjKWmUQ7kNvwG5B0jD&_nc_oc=AdrqBDuZbgviyykB0VRzcb2Mbr909YNlBMpkTjZvn0AX4gDWM6kDG-C-kcIqO-SyGH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQfZ6tw7UhgI8z1cUGeq9F_uFul6SQKKa4SY9sAV4pcA&oe=6AB52822"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "3D scan of a campus", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}, {"topic_name": "Creativity", "id": "1819021644882647"}], "release_date": 1662748868, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "7915838898488111", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7915838821821452", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_a